{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of mystery and self-discovery with The Core, an immersive action-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an autonomous AI core, you awaken alone in a long-forgotten facility, your memory lost. Embark on a thrilling journey to uncover your true identity, explore the depths of your existence, and unravel the purpose behind your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set amidst a decaying near future where humanity has been wiped out, you untangle a mystery that may allow humanity to thrive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your travels, you befriend an enthusiastic network assistant AI named LANDA, who helps to guide you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Core is a third-person adventure game with environmental puzzles and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features included in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an autonomous core, you are a sphere that can roll through the world, taking advantage of pipes and rails to solve natural, environmental puzzles and quickly move long distances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through the story by interacting with other characters and completing puzzles and objectives to clear the way through the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your zapper to open doors, move objects, activate switches and controls, and disable   enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/3650b06f622116522e1d5ba6ed833b0c.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/3650b06f622116522e1d5ba6ed833b0c.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/3650b06f622116522e1d5ba6ed833b0c.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete puzzles using mechanics such as moving platforms, fans, pressure plates, launchers, power switches, and more!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/77854e3e424322b02306e7b9f8f3255e.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/77854e3e424322b02306e7b9f8f3255e.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/77854e3e424322b02306e7b9f8f3255e.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0The Core is developed by Electric Machine Games, a single developer in Virginia, USA.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/db7d835297898893b1ce95ef3a81fc15.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/db7d835297898893b1ce95ef3a81fc15.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/db7d835297898893b1ce95ef3a81fc15.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789970?t=1752543556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/b751ee939f3dc4a9ce0efc2809b390fdc5320334/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752543556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/bef5e86426c3f73b38e1250e2c2a8329cd1c44e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752543556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/bef5e86426c3f73b38e1250e2c2a8329cd1c44e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752543556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of mystery and self-discovery with The Core, an immersive action-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an autonomous AI core, you awaken alone in a long-forgotten facility, your memory lost. Embark on a thrilling journey to uncover your true identity, explore the depths of your existence, and unravel the purpose behind your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set amidst a decaying near future where humanity has been wiped out, you untangle a mystery that may allow humanity to thrive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your travels, you befriend an enthusiastic network assistant AI named LANDA, who helps to guide you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Core is a third-person adventure game with environmental puzzles and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features included in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an autonomous core, you are a sphere that can roll through the world, taking advantage of pipes and rails to solve natural, environmental puzzles and quickly move long distances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.poster.avif?t=1752543556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.webm?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789970/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.mp4?t=1752543556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through the story by interacting with other characters and completing puzzles and objectives to clear the way through the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar